Vial CLI tool allows to configure keyboard through VIA/Vial protocol with
command line interface. It supports QMK keycodes notation together with aliases.

Keys, encoders, combos, macros, tap dances, key overrides and alt repeat keys
are supported. RGB lighting control is supported too.

Non-colored underglow is not supported for now because there is no devices with
such features around me.

Tool support --help for tool as a whole and for all subcommands.
